The crash you're seeing on attach/autoplay is almost certainly coming from the UI thread being blocked during the host call (or from property updates that try to run off-thread). The cleanest single fix is to wrap the post-await work in `Dispatcher.UIThread.InvokeAsync` so everything that touches the view model or XAML stays on the UI thread.

